<div class="page-header">
    <h1>About FCAMS</h1>
</div>
<div class="panel">
    <p>The Financial Compliance &amp; Audit Management System (FCAMS) is a student portfolio project demonstrating
       a realistic, end-to-end ASP.NET MVC 5 application: a data-driven compliance rule engine, full audit-trail
       logging, role-based authorization, stored-procedure-backed data access, and PDF/Crystal Reports reporting.</p>
    <p>See the project <code>README.md</code> and <code>Docs/</code> folder for architecture notes, the database
       design, security notes, and Azure deployment instructions.</p>
</div>
